{"id":"206f27768179abc2","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-order7-closed-interval.md","title":"ZFC Order7 Closed Interval","display":"df-zfc-order7-closed-interval — ZFC Order7 Closed Interval","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order7-closed-interval","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order7-closed-interval"],"display":"df-zfc-order7-closed-interval — ZFC Order7 Closed Interval","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order7-closed-interval"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order7-closed-interval</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order7-closed-interval — ZFC Order7 Closed Interval"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R,a,b,I\\in V\">\\(X,R,a,b,I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ClosedInterval}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ClosedInterval}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}closed\\text{-}interval} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ClosedInterval}_S(X,R,a,b,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land a\\in X\\land b\\in X\\land I=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\langle a,x\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle x,b\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}closed\\text{-}interval} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ClosedInterval}_S(X,R,a,b,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land a\\in X\\land b\\in X\\land I=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\langle a,x\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle x,b\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The interval is relative to an actual partial order and endpoints in its carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R,a,b,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ClosedInterval}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}closed\\text{-}interval} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7ClosedInterval}_S(X,R,a,b,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land a\\in X\\land b\\in X\\land I=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\langle a,x\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle x,b\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true}],"bytes":887,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2951","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-order7-closed-interval.md|58-df-zfc-order7-closed-interval]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}